# DaServer wire manifest (ADR-076): the layout of this assembly's [NinoType] types on the wire and in stored records.
# Positional layouts are frozen, version-tolerant types take new fields at their end, keyed types any key that keeps
# its type. Record changes: dotnet build -p:UpdateWireManifest=true
